      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a piece for my sports blog about that city council decision to block the stadium funding. can you write a quick summary for me that explains why refusing to fund the stadium is a short-sighted move that's gonna end up hurting the local economy? just want a few paragraphs on the economic downsides of them being so stingy.",
